# Audition candidate dumps (see .gitignore). Gone from git, but a checkout that
# ran an audition round locally would otherwise drag hundreds of MB back into
# the build context and the image.
public/assets/audio/_music-pool
public/assets/audio/_stk-audition
public/assets/audio/_engine-audition
# Re-fetchable third-party bytes (see .gitignore): the race-music masters and the
# Kenney kits. No COPY targets them, but a tree that has run `npm run fetch:music`
# would otherwise push 164 MB through the build context on every image build for
# files that never enter the image.
.cache
